{
 "golden": "v1.yaml",
 "method": "The (question, section) pairs that some configuration puts in its 4,800-character context but v1.yaml leaves unjudged, in two strata (analysis/samples.py). focused: every pair inside a heading or fixed configuration's context; all judged. scattered: pairs reached only by paragraph-family contexts; 200 judged, taken in order of sha256('20261120:unjudged:{question}:{location}'). Grades already given under the same protocol are reused when a pair is re-drawn; all are graded on full text under v1's rubric, with the question's known answers for reference. Kept out of v1.yaml so v1's construction stays the same for every configuration; used by analysis/unjudged_sensitivity.py.",
